Subject: Inquiry Regarding Cogon Grass Testing, Fiber Extraction, and
Textile Production

Greetings!

Re: Your recent response on our last email.

We would like to know if your testing center accepts samples of cogon grass
for production and testing processes.

Additionally, we would also like to know if your facility offers the
extraction of fibers from cogon grass preferably using mechanical retting.

Lastly, does the facility offer services to convert the cogon grass fibers
into textiles products?

Any information regarding the processes, fees, or requirements of creating
textiles from cogon grass fibers would be greatly appreciated.

Could you kindly provide details on your services, procedures, and any
prerequisites or limitations associated with these services?

We are particularly interested in exploring the potential of cogon grass as
a sustainable material for various applications, and we believe your
expertise and facilities could be helpful in our study.

Thank you for your time and consideration. We look forward to your response=
.

Warm regards,

Patrio Gabriel A. Patdu

